 Company.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please find attached below the details of two fire i=
ncidents that occurred on 22 October 2015 at two separate salt water dispos=
al facilities which are RJ
<span class=3D"SpellE">Horz</span> FED #1 and the Booster FED #1, located i=
n Eddy County, New Mexico.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">We have initiated the survey of both the facilities =
to access damage and submit the report with estimated cost of repair work, =
will share the same by next week.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Request you to please initiate a claim for the incid=
ent and share the Claim# at the earliest. Let me know if you need anything =
additional from me to initiate the claim.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Regards,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
