<p class=3D"MsoNormal">We have contacted our survey company (Independent Su=
rveys Ltd.) and soon a Survey Engineer will be visiting the locations for t=
o survey the damage and submit the report with estimated cost of repair wor=
k. In the meantime, I am initiating
 your claim for the damages with EXL Insurance Company<o:p></o:p></p>
