<br>
<b>Sent:</b> Monday, October 26, 2015 04:13 PM<br>
<b>To:</b> Greg Carpenter &lt;Greg.Carpenter@broadway.com&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> Property claim =96 Fire Incident<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Hi,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please be informed that we would like to initiate th=
e claim for two fire incidents that occurred on the evening of 21 October 2=
015 at two separate salt water disposal facilities which are RJ
<span class=3D"SpellE">Horz</span> FED #1 and the Booster FED #1, located i=
n Eddy County, New Mexico.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The fire cause by the lightning strikes from the sto=
rm in Eddy County and was extensive. Fire department volunteers from the to=
wns of Otis, Happy Valley responded to the incidents and extinguished both =
the fires around 3am on 22<sup>nd</sup>
 October. <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The damages are covered under my policy with EXL Ins=
urance Company Companies (Policy No. B123456/16).<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please let me know if you need anything additional f=
rom me to initiate the claim for both the facilities.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Thanks, Chris<o:p></o:p></p>
